{"unit_id":"xiaozhuyuqing__dsh-repeat-guard#feature-interrupt","repo":"xiaozhuyuqing/dsh-repeat-guard","commit":"dd485c4b3d65e2a50a48209b6eab2c7a711d5362","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-repeat-guard 的功能「思考复读拦截」：检查模型 reasoning-delta 中连续命中的配置短句；当命中阈值后仍有新的思考片段时，放行触发行并补齐 block-end 与 finish(stop)，结束本次生成。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/stream-guard.ts:51-73","src/detect.ts:66-82"]}
